WEBVTT

00:13:59.199 --> 00:14:01.732
in terms of what they are expected to be,

00:14:01.756 --> 00:14:04.201
and fearlessness
is one of the expectations

00:14:04.225 --> 00:14:08.097
that we are memed to death about
in our culture.

00:14:08.121 --> 00:14:13.260
"Go punch the world in the face
and take it on! Kill fear and bury fear!"

00:14:13.284 --> 00:14:16.750
And I don't ask that of myself
in any way whatsoever.

00:14:16.774 --> 00:14:20.440
I'm not interested in becoming
a person who is fearless,

00:14:20.464 --> 00:14:25.335
because the few human beings I've met
in my life who I would define as fearless

00:14:25.359 --> 00:14:27.475
were clearly sociopaths.

00:14:27.499 --> 00:14:28.653
You know?

00:14:28.677 --> 00:14:31.938
You look in their eyes, and there's
something very important missing.